      "comment": "WENDELL (6) sets the benchmark based on his NSW form and looks well placed first-up for Ella Clarke. His Hawkesbury run was underwhelming after being a top betting choice, but his prior effort at Warwick Farm and one placing from two good track attempts are encouraging. Jarrod Todd, the top jockey here, strengthens his case. KARMAROA (4) is lightly raced, returning after a ninth at Pakenham Synthetic, beaten three and a half lengths as a long shot. With blinkers off and a strong local trainer, he has potential. MISTIFYZOU (5) had a poor showing in a metro Class 2 last start while racing wide, but returns to easier company and has one win and one place from three tries at this distance. TENACIOUS ZEUS (2) the best of the rest.",
